  "body": "## Summary\n- Add `secondary_github_token` to `run-agent-task` and pass `AGENT_CROSS_REPO_PAT` from agent workflows.\n- Expose the additive token as `INPUT_SECONDARY_GITHUB_TOKEN` while preserving primary `GH_TOKEN`/`GITHUB_TOKEN` behavior.\n- Document setup, recommended fine-grained PAT scopes, read-only vs write-capable use, and security guidance.\n- Add workflow contract tests for the new input and caller wiring.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm --prefix .agent run build`\n- YAML parse check for workflows/action files\n- `node --test .agent/dist/__tests__/envelope.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nCloses #312\n",
